# GUARD-01: protected specifications and tests require the presenter's review.
/spec/        @dgaspard
/docs/specs/  @dgaspard
/.claude/     @dgaspard
/.github/     @dgaspard
/AGENTS.md    @dgaspard

# ENG-02: portable review/security engines require review before they change —
# mandatory review, not an immutable hash freeze (lighter than GUARD-01 above,
# since these are meant to evolve as new defect classes get discovered).
/tools/security/portable/  @dgaspard
/tools/review/portable/    @dgaspard
